              "ev-90c1760a468a-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked about the consequence of that and how often the issue arises."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice BREYER",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90c1760a468a200bf8fcdd78bfd92d9e9a2c41d7ed74a47eb4b627f4f317c1b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-90c1760a468a-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer later asked, \u201cI\u2019m confused now. You\u2019re saying both sides agreed that section 1447(d) does not apply?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90c1760a468a200bf8fcdd78bfd92d9e9a2c41d7ed74a47eb4b627f4f317c1b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-90c1760a468a-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg noted that a Nassau County court could decline to treat the issue as preclusive."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90c1760a468a200bf8fcdd78bfd92d9e9a2c41d7ed74a47eb4b627f4f317c1b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-90c1760a468a-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter expressed confusion, asking, \u201cWhy can\u2019t it?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90c1760a468a200bf8fcdd78bfd92d9e9a2c41d7ed74a47eb4b627f4f317c1b3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-90c1760a468a-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts said counsel could change the law if the Court wishes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90c1760a468a200bf8fcdd78bfd92d9e9a2c41d7ed74a47eb4b627f4f317c1b3",
